id: SLS-010
ilities: [integrity]
source: cpm
maturity: 2
action: block
title: EOL Lambda runtime
category: security
severity: error
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .yaml .yml .json
  filenames: serverless.yml serverless.yaml template.yaml template.yml
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ .git/ vendor/ node_modules/
  content_contains: runtime
patterns:
  - regex: runtime:\s*["']?(nodejs14|nodejs12|nodejs10|python3\.7|python3\.6|python2|dotnetcore3\.1|ruby2\.5|java8$|java8[^.])
    message: "EOL Lambda runtime — security patches no longer applied"
fix: Upgrade to a supported runtime. nodejs20.x, python3.12, java21, dotnet8, ruby3.3 are current LTS.
